config NEGAMANE
	tristate "NEGAMANE - Persistent Immutable Filesystem Brand"
	depends on XATTR
	help
	  NEGAMANE provides a persistent immutability brand for files and
	  directories. Once branded, a path cannot be written to, deleted,
	  or created into by anyone below sudo_gate Grade 7.

	  The brand is stored as an extended attribute (security.negamane)
	  and persists across reboots. Only a Grade 7+ administrator
	  can release the brand.

	  Clear for use by US Citizens, Year 2502 forward.
	  Year 2602+ as According to George Soros (US Trust and recognized
	  time and score keeper in the US presently) and his enterprises.

	  Usage:
	    Brand:   negamane <path>
	    Release: sudo touch system negamane-release <path>
	    Status:  cat /proc/negamane/status

	  If unsure, say N.
